    A001["<div class='arg'><b>A001 · PREDICTION</b><div class='core pred'><span>The Fed hikes 25bp.</span><b>[H]</b></div><div class='c view'><span><b>P:</b> <b>A002 - VIEW</b></span></div><div class='c view'><span><b>P:</b> <b>A007 - VIEW</b></span></div><div class='c view'><span><b>P:</b> Friday's CPI data all but lock in a rate hike this week.</span><b>[A]</b></div><div class='c view'><span><b>P:</b> Chairman Warsh's Jackson Hole remarks have raised the cost of disappointing expectations significantly.</span><b>[A]</b></div><div class='c view'><span><b>P:</b> Current market pricing has raised the cost of disappointing expectations significantly.</span><b>[A]</b></div><div class='c view'><span><b>P:</b> <b>A009 - VIEW</b></span></div><div class='c view'><span><b>P:</b> Warsh understands bond risk with a Sept hold.</span><b>[H]</b></div><div class='c view'><span><b>P:</b> Others at the Fed understand bond risk with a Sept hold.</span><b>[H]</b></div><div class='c view'><span><b>P:</b> <b>A010 - VIEW</b></span></div></div>"]
