    A003["<div class='arg'><b>A003 · VIEW</b><div class='core view'><span>The Fed risks a sharp and disorderly UST long end move.</span><b>[A]</b></div><div class='c fc'><span><b>P:</b> US 30Y rapidly tests 5.75%.</span><b>[H]</b></div><div class='c view'><span><b>P:</b> <b>A004 - VIEW</b></span></div><div class='c view'><span><b>P:</b> <b>A005 - VIEW</b></span></div><div class='c view'><span><b>P:</b> Investor confidence in the Fed is limited.</span><b>[H]</b></div><div class='c sup'><span><b>CO:</b> The Fed does not hike with current pricing.</span><b>[HY]</b></div></div>"]
