    A009["<div class='arg'><b>A009 · VIEW</b><div class='core view'><span>Friday's twist flattening of the Treasury curve provides further justification for a hike.</span><b>[H]</b></div><div class='c view'><span><b>P:</b> Warsh can point to Friday's twist flattening of the Treasury curve as evidence of tighter policy reinforcing inflation-fighting credibility.</span><b>[H]</b></div></div>"]
